          "type": "step",
          "id": "starting-off:g9yqck",
          "html": "Go north of Fort Forinthry and <i>enter</i> the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Crypt_(Wilderness)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wilderness crypt</a> entrance. Pray Protect from Magic against the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Risen_ghost\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">risen ghosts</a> inside.",
          "text": "Go north of Fort Forinthry and enter the Wilderness crypt entrance. Pray Protect from Magic against the risen ghosts inside.",
