        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "finding-artefacts:1sx7pns",
          "html": "Collect 20 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Dragonkin_artefact\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">dragonkin artefacts</a> in the tomb. Kill any <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Tomb_zombie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tomb zombies</a> that appear, and then collect the artefacts they drop. The zombies are based on your combat level, e.g. 3,200 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Life_points\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">life points</a> at <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Combat_level\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">combat level</a> 152. One can be collected from each Dragonkin artefact hotspot throughout the crypt as well.",
          "text": "Collect 20 dragonkin artefacts in the tomb. Kill any tomb zombies that appear, and then collect the artefacts they drop. The zombies are based on your combat level, e.g. 3,200 life points at combat level 152. One can be collected from each Dragonkin artefact hotspot throughout the crypt as well.",
