    {
      "id": "undead-waves",
      "title": "Undead waves",
      "anchor": "Undead_waves",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "You cannot bank inbetween waves. Prepare for a long fight. If you are lower level, you can let your allies deal most of the damage and you can focus on the enemies who attack you. If you run away from your attacker, it might shift its focus on your ally, meaning you can save food."
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "undead-waves:19jid0p",
          "html": "Defeat 12 waves of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Zemouregal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Zemouregal</a>&#39;s minions. After each wave of enemies, you have to activate necrotic energy and sometimes choose a power-up for one of your allies. See the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ancient_Awakening#Undead_waves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">full guide</a> for details on all waves and power-ups.",
          "text": "Defeat 12 waves of Zemouregal's minions. After each wave of enemies, you have to activate necrotic energy and sometimes choose a power-up for one of your allies. See the full guide for details on all waves and power-ups.",
          "dialogue": [],
